        "raw": "Step right up for the most brutal entertainment event in the multiverses. Advanced Kaargra Warfang gathers together Lady Liberty, Daedalus, Star Knight and Pseudo to engage in gladiatorial combat within Tartarus.\n\n![image|231x500](upload://m9DCvbOZM6ByH3P7r8u03gYM18A.jpeg)\n\nThree strikes and I'm out. Can't get through this one so far. Kaargra goes to her flipside immediately which shoots the villains favour gathering into high gear. I was hoping to rifle through the villain deck to make use of Fickle Fans, but that isn't working. Bursting Kaagra down has been too slow. By the time the heroes get to that point, the villains win on the next turn. Maybe the idea is to stack the Title deck?\n\nWhatever the solution, this week's scenario is extra difficult ... at least for me. :) Good luck heroes.",
