      {
        "id": 252736,
        "name": "",
        "username": "Omegatron",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omegatron/{size}/4904_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-05-27T17:01:02.727Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near mint for me.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nImage</summary>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9\" title=\"20230523203243_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9_2_690x431.jpeg\" alt=\"20230523203243_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"tNlGcQJ8MsKoTnYWFu8TOybSL9v\" width=\"690\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9_2_690x431.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9_2_1035x646.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9_2_1380x862.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d0d324064e792e45952fab101ca16b81a5c651c9_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230523203243_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1200 256 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</details>\n<p>Combining Star Knight Oath with Shield The Innocent to turn off damage for a couple of rounds turned out to be crucial for focusing Kaargra down. Pseudo also spent the last couple of rounds using Risky Impersonation to stop any more cards from coming out.</p>\n<p>I had a funny ending to the game where hitting Kaargra triggered Mindbreaker, making her hit herself which triggered Deathcaller to destroy herself (which luckily bypasses Unbreakable).</p>",
