        "id": 252741,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-05-28T12:59:53.086Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I finally beat it on my approximately 37th try x_x</p>\n<p>The thing that was different? Kaargra never got Champion. I have no idea how I managed that, but it meant her Mindbreaker damage couldn’t hit the heroes thanks to Pseudo’s anti-psychic card. The rest was just overloading Daedalus so he could bombard to his heart’s content and like… just kind of playing it. Had over 30 favor at the end with no one under 15 HP. I hate that it took this long and I’m glad it’s over! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
