        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-05-29T17:25:57.334Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near-Mint for me.</p>\n<p>I also avoided Kaargra getting Champion; she picked up Death-Caller and Mindbreaker. With Pseudo in play, that meant that every time we poked Kaargra she’d zap her gladiators, and she kept killing them. It was still pretty close; I had to use Pseudo’s discard effects to reach the second Fickle Fans in order to win. But I pulled it off!</p>",
